Faithful port of the canonical Shorebird shell integration (codepush-extraction
patch 0003), rebranded sankofa, adapted to our vendored libupdater layout:
- updater.{h,cc}: Updater abstraction (Real wraps the Rust C API via
  third_party/updater/include/updater_engine.h; NoOp on unsupported platforms;
  Mock for tests) + singleton.
- sankofa.{h,cc}: ConfigureSankofa(release_version, libapp_paths, storage dirs,
  yaml) — the real pipeline: sankofa_init -> ValidateNextBootPatch ->
  NextBootPatchPath -> ReportLaunchStart -> DartIsolate::SetSankofaBootPatchPath;
  + StartUpdateThread; + ReportLaunchSuccess(). In-memory FileCallbacks impl.
- BUILD.gn: source_set linking lib/<abi>/libupdater.a + SANKOFA_PLATFORM_SUPPORTED
  on android/ios-arm64.

VERIFICATION PENDING the engine build (blocked on the macOS Metal Toolchain for
Impeller). Remaining wiring: shell/common/BUILD.gn dep + shell.cc
ReportLaunchSuccess + embedder ConfigureSankofa call (iOS FlutterEngine / Android
FlutterMain).

